{"content":[{"c":["TIMNATH-HERES*, TIMNATH-SERAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["The city that Joshua the son of Nun asked for and that was given to him as his inheritance when the land was divided among the tribes of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.49-50","r":"Josh.19.49-50","rawR":"Josh.19.49-50","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.49-50","value":"Josh.19.49-50"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:49-50"},"). Joshua rebuilt the city and settled there. When Joshua died, he was buried on the property located in the hill country of Ephraim, north of the mountain of Gaash (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.24.30","r":"Josh.24.30","rawR":"Josh.24.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.24.30","value":"Josh.24.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 24:30"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.2.9","r":"Judg.2.9","rawR":"Judg.2.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.2.9","value":"Judg.2.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 2:9"}," gives the same location, but the name is Timnath-heres (see ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg), which means “territory [or portion] of the sun.” This seems to indicate that the city used to be a place for sun worship."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"TimnathHeresTimnathSerah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 19:49-50","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.49-50","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.49-50","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.49-50"},{"anchorText":"Jos 24:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.24.30","rawQueryValue":"Josh.24.30","sourceRefExact":"Josh.24.30"},{"anchorText":"Judges 2:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.2.9","rawQueryValue":"Judg.2.9","sourceRefExact":"Judg.2.9"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"fa84cf9798fc152d90a39cc4d5a10d971e1c8078d352d61020dc0564c8cfe692","sourceItemName":"TimnathHeresTimnathSerah","sourceItemOrder":163,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"TimnathHeresTimnathSerah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Timnath-Heres*, Timnath-Serah","title":"Timnath-Heres*, Timnath-Serah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}